1
00:00:00,073 --> 00:00:01,073
Ah, Hyeon-wu

2
00:00:02,116 --> 00:00:04,040
It hurts, be gentle…

3
00:00:05,616 --> 00:00:06,751
Hey, Hyeong-ju

4
00:00:07,321 --> 00:00:08,174
Hurry up, Hyeong-ju

5
00:00:08,257 --> 00:00:09,756
Okay, I'm coming

6
00:00:14,932 --> 00:00:16,692
Where does he get
that swagger?

7
00:00:17,471 --> 00:00:19,595
Is his hoodie
from a luxury brand?

8
00:00:19,678 --> 00:00:20,742
Should I just ask him?

9
00:00:23,398 --> 00:00:25,400
He helped me
so maybe he'll tell me

10
00:00:28,417 --> 00:00:29,155
Sorry…

11
00:00:29,238 --> 00:00:30,598
I wasn't watching
where I was going

12
00:00:37,555 --> 00:00:38,555
Watch yourself

13
00:00:39,185 --> 00:00:39,902
Okay

14
00:00:39,985 --> 00:00:40,985
That's it

15
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,585
That overflowing
swagger isn't from

16
00:00:42,668 --> 00:00:44,386
his clothes
but from his strength

17
00:00:44,469 --> 00:00:47,667
His indifference
is so cool

18
00:00:49,689 --> 00:00:51,760
The strong never lose
their composure

19
00:00:52,485 --> 00:00:54,847
Be cool, be cool…

20
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:56,985
Hey, loser

21
00:00:57,432 --> 00:00:58,809
Be cool

22
00:00:59,228 --> 00:01:00,484
Be cool

23
00:01:01,363 --> 00:01:02,363
Watch yourself

24
00:01:02,625 --> 00:01:04,148
Build up…

25
00:01:04,231 --> 00:01:05,555
a wall of composure

26
00:01:06,878 --> 00:01:07,878
You little…

27
00:01:08,819 --> 00:01:09,862
You punk

28
00:01:13,191 --> 00:01:15,326
I've still got
a long way to go

29
00:01:18,885 --> 00:01:21,206
How do I learn
that swagger?

30
00:01:22,281 --> 00:01:24,571
Wait, I know a way

31
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:27,003
That's right

32
00:01:27,183 --> 00:01:29,957
A relationship
is important

33
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:33,426
I have an excuse
to get closer to him

34
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,448
Hey, Hyeon-wu

35
00:01:41,737 --> 00:01:43,667
Could you teach me
some Jiu-Jitsu?
